        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana OK2015U, 2\" x 1-1/2\" Olive Knuckle Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana Olive Knuckle Hinge is a Paumelle hinge where the knuckles have an olive shape. It is best suited for light-weight doors such as kitchen cabinet doors or bathroom vanity doors. This solid brass hinge measures 2 inches high and 1-1/2 inches wide. Founded in 1977, Deltana is the architectural hardware manufacturer with a proven record for exceptional service and quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-OK2015U-specifications.gif?v=1704354607\" width=\"587\" height=\"322\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana OK2015U Specifications\"></center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which of the beautiful 10 finishes you choose, the parts will still be made of high quality solid brass. The Deltana PVD Polished Brass Finish (CR003) is recommended for harsh environments such as high salt or intense temperatures; it has the appearance of polished brass but without the ordinary problems such as easy tarnishing, discoloration, flaking, or pitting commonly associated with a standard polished brass finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana OK2015U Lightweight Door Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Wing Width: 3/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Height: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Sold Individually</li>\r\n<Li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screw: #7x3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-OK2015-speifications.pdf?v=1704262253\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana OK2015U Hinge Specification (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this olive knuckle hinge: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Olive Knuckle Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Olive Knuckle Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-olive-kunckle-handing.gif?v=1704354537\"  width=\"411\" height=\"140\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "2 Inch x 1-1/2 Inch Olive Knuckle Hinge, Deltana OK2015U",
                "description": "Deltana OK2015U 2 x 1-1/2 inch Olive Knuckle Hinge - The 2 inch solid brass Olive Knuckle Hinge is a full mortise, extruded hinge. It is made by Deltana, a leader in quality architectural hardware. Available in 10 finishes, this cabinet door hinge uses a #7x3/4 inch wood screw.",
                "keywords": "Deltana OK2015U olive knuckle hinges, deltana solid brass cabinet hinges, del-OK2015U, deltana OK2015, 2 inch cabinet door hinges, deltana architectural hardware hinges, olive-shaped knuckles, stylish cabinet hinges, kitchen cabinet hinges, Deltana OK2015U Lightweight Door Hinges, DEL-OK2015U15, DEL-OK2015U15A, DEL-OK2015U10B, DEL-OK2015U19, DEL-OK2015US26, DEL-OK2015US26D, DEL-OK2015U3, DEL-OK2015U5, DEL-OK2015U3UNL, DEL-OK2015CR003,"
